OL,3,GNEWSAAshford Odeon restoration plans
OL,4,Arevealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew designs have revealed how Ashford's
OL,7,Fformer Odeon cinema could look once it
OL,8,Fhas been restored.
OL,10,FThe cinema was built in 1936 but has
OL,11,Fbeen empty since 2018, last being used
OL,12,Fby Mecca Bingo. Now, Ashford Borough
OL,13,FCouncil says plans to bring it back to
OL,14,Flife are one step closer.
OL,16,FThose plans include a new performance
OL,17,Fspace, a cafe/bar with an "informal
OL,18,Fworkspace", and a gallery. The
OL,19,Fbuilding's ballroom will also be
OL,20,Frestored and would be available for
OL,21,Fhire.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
