OL,3,GNEWSAAshford Odeon restoration plans
OL,4,Arevealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public can view the plans at a
OL,7,Fconsultation event on 18 September,
OL,8,Fbetween 10:00 and 16:00 BST, at County
OL,9,FSquare shopping centre.
